{
	"name": "Flag of Dragonfear (Red/Gold)",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-flag-red-white.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Few things spark more fear in the heart of mortals than the roar of a dragon, a roar this banner contains. As an action, you can raise the banner and unleash a roar. When you do so, the magic of the banner causes your roar to resound with the might and power of a dragon which gives the [[/condition id=frightened]] condition to all enemies within 120ft for up to one minute. A Charisma saving throw is required to resist the effect, and can be repeated at the end of each turn, the DC can be found below.</p><ul><li>White/Brass: Rare, 4,000 gp, DC 14, Cold</li><li>Black/Copper: Rare, 5,000 gp, DC 15, Acid</li><li>Green/Bronze: Very Rare, 7,000 gp, DC 16, Poison</li><li>Blue/Silver: Very Rare, 9,000 gp, DC 17, Lightning</li><li>Red/Gold: Legendary, 12,000gp, DC 19, Fire</li></ul><p>You also gain resistance to energy damage based on the dragon type so long as you are attuned to the flag of dragonfear.</p>",
